    "| :--- | :--- | :--- |",
    "| **[Entity]** | [Purpose] | [Related entities] |",
    "",
    "### 3.2. How data enters, changes and leaves",
    "",
    "[Describe how data enters, changes, persists, and leaves the system.]",
    "",
